  "description": "GRAFT is a vision-language model for remote sensing images trained without textual annotations by aligning satellite images with CLIP's ground image encoder using large-scale ground-satellite image pairs. It enables zero-shot, open-vocabulary classification, retrieval, segmentation, and VQA for satellite imagery.",
